[
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_01_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 3.130583,
    "frames": 100,
    "text": "最後の日に会った女性で 卒業したら……ヤバすぎた",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_02_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.918625,
    "frames": 94,
    "text": "深夜の森の中、車の中で独り誰かを待つ男",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_03_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 0.771167,
    "frames": 29,
    "text": "初めまして",
    "speaker": 8
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_03_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 3.395875,
    "frames": 108,
    "text": "そこに若い女の子が現れ、男は彼女を車へ迎え入れた",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_04_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.256042,
    "frames": 74,
    "text": "すみません、何もかも用意してもらって…",
    "speaker": 8
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_04_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 1.390292,
    "frames": 48,
    "text": "来て貰えただけで嬉しいです",
    "speaker": 11
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_04_03.wav",
    "durationSec": 1.103208,
    "frames": 39,
    "text": "ひとりだと心細く...",
    "speaker": 11
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_05_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 3.653625,
    "frames": 116,
    "text": "エスエヌエスをきっかけに集まった彼らは、互いに人生に絶望していた",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_06_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 1.477583,
    "frames": 50,
    "text": "お若いのになんでこんなことを…？",
    "speaker": 11
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_06_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 0.775708,
    "frames": 29,
    "text": "イジメですね…",
    "speaker": 8
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_07_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 3.575375,
    "frames": 113,
    "text": "どうやら根暗で愛想が悪いことが、ターゲットにされた原因なのだという",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_08_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 1.850833,
    "frames": 62,
    "text": "お兄さんは借金が理由でしたっけ",
    "speaker": 8
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_08_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 3.384792,
    "frames": 108,
    "text": "男は毎日残業に追われ、稼いだかねも借金に消えていた",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_09_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 1.861833,
    "frames": 62,
    "text": "でも今日で 苦しいのも終わり",
    "speaker": 8
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_09_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.572083,
    "frames": 83,
    "text": "いざ準備に取り掛かると 男は思い悩んでしまう",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_10_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 1.64175,
    "frames": 55,
    "text": "やり残したことでもあるんですか…？",
    "speaker": 8
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_10_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 1.764125,
    "frames": 59,
    "text": "なけなしの財産で最後の晩餐をと",
    "speaker": 11
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_10_03.wav",
    "durationSec": 1.361375,
    "frames": 47,
    "text": "でもまったく食欲わかなくて…",
    "speaker": 11
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_11_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 1.73075,
    "frames": 58,
    "text": "どうせなら初めてを卒業したかったな…",
    "speaker": 11
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_11_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.939167,
    "frames": 94,
    "text": "最後の日だと言うのに 突然未練を語り始めた男",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_12_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 0.916917,
    "frames": 34,
    "text": "すると彼女から",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_12_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 1.833333,
    "frames": 61,
    "text": "じゃあ未練 解消しましょうか",
    "speaker": 8
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_12_03.wav",
    "durationSec": 1.968,
    "frames": 65,
    "text": "私のからだなら お好きにどうぞ…",
    "speaker": 8
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/0002/manga_13_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.916708,
    "frames": 94,
    "text": "作品の詳細は動画の 説明欄からチェックしてね！",
    "speaker": 13
  }
]